#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:20
msgid ""
"Pwanimate is an AI academic companion natively integrated into PwaniNet. "
"Built specifically for Pwani University, Pwanimate bridges campus academic "
"records, lecture materials, student collaboration, and course information to "
"help you navigate your academic journey."
msgstr ""
"Pwanimate ni msaidizi wa masomo unaotumia AI na umejumuishwa moja kwa moja "
"kwenye PwaniNet. Umetengenezwa mahsusi kwa Chuo Kikuu cha Pwani, "
"ukiunganisha kumbukumbu za kitaaluma za chuo, nyenzo za mihadhara, "
"ushirikiano wa wanafunzi na taarifa za kozi ili kukusaidia katika safari "
"yako ya masomo."

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:26
msgid "Key Capabilities"
msgstr "Uwezo mkuu"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:32
msgid "Document Retrieval & Citations"
msgstr "Utafutaji wa nyaraka na marejeo"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:35
msgid ""
"Unified retrieval searches campus documents, course outlines, syllabus, and "
"lecture notes via semantic and keyword search, providing citations with "
"direct source links."
msgstr ""
"Utafutaji wa pamoja hutafuta nyaraka za chuo, mihutasari ya kozi, silabasi "
"na dondoo za mihadhara kwa kutumia maana na maneno muhimu, kisha kutoa "
"marejeo yenye viungo vya moja kwa moja vya vyanzo."

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:43
msgid "Student Peer Discovery"
msgstr "Ugunduzi wa wanafunzi wenzako"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:46
msgid ""
"Discovers active peers based on shared skills, interests, and collaboration "
"availability, strictly respecting user privacy settings and student profile "
"visibility."
msgstr ""
"Hutambua wanafunzi wenza walio hai kwa kuzingatia ujuzi na maslahi "
"yanayofanana pamoja na utayari wa kushirikiana, huku ukiheshimu kikamilifu "
"mipangilio ya faragha na mwonekano wa wasifu."

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:54
msgid "Campus & Group Awareness"
msgstr "Ufahamu wa chuo na vikundi"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:57
msgid ""
"Contextual summaries of course announcements, departmental notices, and "
"enrolled group updates directly within your chat."
msgstr ""
"Muhtasari wenye muktadha wa matangazo ya kozi, taarifa za idara na masasisho "
"ya vikundi ulivyojiunga navyo, moja kwa moja kwenye mazungumzo yako."

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:65
msgid "Personalized Preferences"
msgstr "Mapendeleo yaliyobinafsishwa"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:68
msgid ""
"Customizes conversational tone, response style, and personal instructions "
"tailored to your preferences while remaining subordinate to system safety "
"and academic integrity guidelines."
msgstr ""
"Hubinafsisha mtindo wa mazungumzo, namna ya kujibu na maagizo yako kulingana "
"na mapendeleo yako, huku ukifuata kanuni za usalama za mfumo na uadilifu wa "
"kitaaluma."

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:77
msgid "Academic Boundaries & Privacy"
msgstr "Mipaka ya kitaaluma na faragha"

#: pwanimate/templates/pwanimate/settings/partials/about_content.html:79
msgid ""
"Pwanimate only accesses campus documents and platform records you are "
"authorized to view. Your personal instructions and preference settings are "
"private to your account and never shared with peers or external services. "
"Pwanimate is an advisory assistant and study tool designed to augment your "
"learning, not replace faculty instruction or university grading systems."
msgstr ""
"Pwanimate hufikia tu nyaraka za chuo na kumbukumbu za jukwaa ambazo "
"umeidhinishwa kuona. Maagizo na mapendeleo yako ni ya faragha kwenye akaunti "
"yako na hayashirikiwi na wanafunzi wenzako au huduma za nje. Pwanimate ni "
"msaidizi wa ushauri na zana ya kujifunzia inayosaidia masomo yako; haichukui "
"nafasi ya mafundisho ya wahadhiri au mifumo ya upimaji ya chuo kikuu."

