"TOTP inayooana."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:115
msgid "Point your phone camera or authenticator app at this code"
msgstr "Elekeza kamera ya simu au programu ya uthibitishaji kwenye msimbo huu"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:124
msgid "Can't scan? Use manual setup key:"
msgstr "Imeshindikana kuchanganua? Tumia ufunguo wa kusanidi mwenyewe:"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:127
msgid "Copy Key"
msgstr "Nakili ufunguo"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:134
msgid "Enter this key manually into your app (Time-based / 30 seconds)."
msgstr ""
"Weka ufunguo huu mwenyewe kwenye programu yako (unaotegemea muda / sekunde "
"30)."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:144
msgid "Step 2 of 2"
msgstr "Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:145
msgid "Enter the 6-Digit Code"
msgstr "Weka msimbo wa tarakimu 6"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:148
msgid ""
"Enter the 6-digit code shown in your authenticator app to activate "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Weka msimbo wa tarakimu 6 unaoonyeshwa kwenye programu yako ya uthibitishaji "
"ili kuwasha ulinzi."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:154
msgid "6-digit code"
msgstr "Msimbo wa tarakimu 6"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:171
msgid "Verify and Activate"
msgstr "Thibitisha na uwashe"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:174
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Ghairi"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:195
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication is Active"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili unatumika"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:196
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Imewashwa"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:199
msgid "Your authenticator app is actively protecting this account."
msgstr "Programu yako ya uthibitishaji inalinda akaunti hii kwa sasa."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:201
msgid "Enrolled on"
msgstr "Ilisajiliwa tarehe"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:212
msgid "Recovery Codes"
msgstr "Misimbo ya kurejesha"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:213
msgid "active recovery code(s) remaining"
msgstr "msimbo/misimbo ya kurejesha inayotumika imesalia"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:217
msgid "Regenerate Codes"
msgstr "Tengeneza upya misimbo"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:224
msgid "Regenerate Recovery Codes"
msgstr "Tengeneza upya misimbo ya kurejesha"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:226
msgid ""
"Regenerating will permanently invalidate all existing recovery codes. Enter "
"your current 6-digit authenticator code to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Kutengeneza upya kutabatilisha kabisa misimbo yote ya sasa ya kurejesha. "
"Weka msimbo wa sasa wa tarakimu 6 wa uthibitishaji ili kuthibitisha."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:242
msgid "Confirm & Generate New Codes"
msgstr "Thibitisha na utengeneze misimbo mipya"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:253
msgid "Disable Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "Zima uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:255
msgid ""
"Disabling 2FA removes the extra security layer. You will only need your "
"password to log in."
msgstr ""
"Kuzima 2FA huondoa hatua ya ziada ya usalama. Utahitaji nenosiri lako pekee "
"ili kuingia."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:259
msgid "Disable 2FA..."
msgstr "Zima 2FA..."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:265
msgid "Enter your 6-digit authenticator code to confirm disabling 2FA:"
msgstr ""
"Weka msimbo wako wa tarakimu 6 wa uthibitishaji ili kuthibitisha kuzima 2FA:"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:281
msgid "Confirm & Disable 2FA"
msgstr "Thibitisha na uzime 2FA"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:302
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication adds an extra layer of security to your PwaniNet "
"account. Once enabled, you'll enter a 6-digit verification code from your "
"authenticator app whenever you perform sensitive security actions."
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili huongeza ulinzi wa akaunti yako ya PwaniNet. "
"Ukiwashwa, utaweka msimbo wa uthibitishaji wa tarakimu 6 kutoka kwenye "
"programu yako unapotekeleza hatua nyeti za usalama."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:309
msgid "1. Get an App"
msgstr "1. Pata programu"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:310
msgid "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator, or Authy."
msgstr "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator au Authy."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:316
msgid "2. Scan QR Code"
msgstr "2. Changanua msimbo wa QR"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:317
msgid "Scan the setup code or enter the key manually."
msgstr "Changanua msimbo wa usanidi au weka ufunguo mwenyewe."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:323
msgid "3. Save Codes"
msgstr "3. Hifadhi misimbo"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:324
msgid "Keep single-use recovery codes in case you lose your phone."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi misimbo ya matumizi moja ya kurejesha akaunti iwapo utapoteza simu "
"yako."

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:331
msgid "Set Up Authenticator"
msgstr "Sanidi programu ya uthibitishaji"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:372
#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:383
msgid "Key Copied!"
msgstr "Ufunguo umenakiliwa!"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:399
#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:406
msgid "All Codes Copied!"
msgstr "Misimbo yote imenakiliwa!"

#: users/templates/users/settings/partials/two_factor_content.html:430
msgid "Downloading\\u2026"
msgstr "Inapakua…"

#: users/views.py:375
msgid "Too many recovery attempts. Please wait 5 minutes before trying again."
msgstr ""
"Majaribio mengi mno ya kurejesha akaunti. Tafadhali subiri dakika 5 kabla ya "
"kujaribu tena."

#: users/views.py:383
msgid "Please enter your username."
msgstr "Tafadhali weka jina lako la mtumiaji."

#: users/views.py:393
msgid "No account found with that username. Please verify and try again."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna akaunti yenye jina hilo la mtumiaji. Tafadhali hakiki kisha ujaribu "
"tena."

#: users/views.py:400
msgid ""
"Two-Factor Authentication is not enabled for this account. Self-service "
"recovery requires 2FA or a recovery code. Please contact support."
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili haujawashwa kwenye akaunti hii. Ili kurejesha "
"akaunti mwenyewe unahitaji 2FA au msimbo wa kurejesha. Tafadhali wasiliana "
"na usaidizi."

#: users/views.py:436
msgid "Your recovery session expired. Please start over."
msgstr "Kipindi chako cha kurejesha akaunti kimeisha. Tafadhali anza tena."

#: users/views.py:455
msgid "Too many incorrect verification attempts. Please start over."
msgstr ""
"Majaribio mengi mno ya uthibitishaji yasiyo sahihi. Tafadhali anza tena."

#: users/views.py:477
msgid "Invalid verification code. Please check and try again."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo wa uthibitishaji si sahihi. Tafadhali hakiki kisha ujaribu tena."

#: users/views.py:512
msgid "Your password reset authorization has expired. Please start over."
msgstr "Ruhusa ya kuweka upya nenosiri lako imeisha. Tafadhali anza tena."

#: users/views.py:531
msgid "Please enter a new password."
msgstr "Tafadhali weka nenosiri jipya."

#: users/views.py:533
msgid "The two password fields did not match."
msgstr "Sehemu mbili za nenosiri hazikulingana."

#: users/views.py:556
msgid ""
"Your password has been reset successfully. Please log in with your new "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Nenosiri lako limewekwa upya. Tafadhali ingia kwa kutumia nenosiri jipya."

#: users/views.py:1463 users/views.py:1505
msgid "Two-factor authentication is already enabled."
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili tayari umewashwa."

#: users/views.py:1536
msgid ""
"Invalid verification code. Please check the time on your device and "
"authenticator app and try again."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo wa uthibitishaji si sahihi. Hakiki saa kwenye kifaa na programu yako "
"ya uthibitishaji kisha ujaribu tena."

#: users/views.py:1548 users/views.py:1580
msgid "Invalid request method."
msgstr "Njia ya ombi si sahihi."

#: users/views.py:1556 users/views.py:1589
msgid "Two-factor authentication is not enabled."
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili haujawashwa."

#: users/views.py:1561
msgid "Please provide your 6-digit authenticator code to disable 2FA."
msgstr "Tafadhali weka msimbo wa tarakimu 6 wa uthibitishaji ili kuzima 2FA."

#: users/views.py:1566
msgid "Two-factor authentication has been successfully disabled."
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa hatua mbili umezimwa kwa mafanikio."

#: users/views.py:1569
msgid ""
"Invalid authentication code. Could not disable two-factor authentication."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo wa uthibitishaji si sahihi. Imeshindwa kuzima uthibitishaji wa hatua "
"mbili."

#: users/views.py:1594
msgid ""
"Please provide your 6-digit authenticator code to regenerate recovery codes."
msgstr ""
"Tafadhali weka msimbo wa tarakimu 6 wa uthibitishaji ili kutengeneza upya "
"misimbo ya kurejesha."

#: users/views.py:1606
msgid "Invalid authentication code. Could not regenerate recovery codes."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo wa uthibitishaji si sahihi. Imeshindwa kutengeneza upya misimbo ya "
"kurejesha."

